  "content": [
    {
      "text": "two sons of Ishmael join Laman1 and Lemuel in rebelling, 1 Ne. 7:6 (18:17). murmuring by Laman1, Lemuel, and sons of Ishmael, 1 Ne. 16:20. encouraged to slay Lehi1 and Nephi1, 1 Ne. 16:37. begin to make merry, 1 Ne. 18:9. admonished to hearken unto Nephi1, 2 Ne. 1:28. angry with Nephi1, 2 Ne. 4:13. the Lord set mark upon sons of Ishmael, Alma 3:7. became Lamanites, Alma 17:19. Lamanites consist of Laman1, Lemuel, sons of Ishmael, and dissenters, Alma 43:13 (47:35).",
